{"author":{"id":"038d65070aa747b6bc9d50939fa697ec871a40ed259db54429b255bbef2581d6"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1793440992,"nonce":"UbSG/e59KXT76UnbEf+NtCuuRfA=","title":"Cold WASM preview takes up to ~30 s in the browser editor","message":"Known latency, accepted for now. A cold preview of the Pocket Studio demo takes up to ~30 s in the browser editor.\n\nThree stages run on a cold build:\n1. Haxe build (RayDE preview-cache stage `bytecode` skips it).\n2. Ash AIR compile (Ash's persistent AIR cache, outside the workspace).\n3. Wasm AOT compile: LLVM backend plus link (RayDE preview-cache stage `wasm` skips the whole Ash step; Ash has no backend reuse).\n\nFlags already minimal: the recipe passes `-O3 --codegen-opt-level 0 --target wasm32-wasip1-threads` (RunConfigurations.hx), with ASH_WASM_FIBERS=1. Ash 0.1.14 at 74e3d5ad contains 909f1977.\n\nMeasurements (Mac, `ash --build ... --air-cache-stats`, direct runs, not through the session):\n- PocketApp (haxe build with the pinned ashui e9cd805, 1.7 MB hl, 18.4 MB wasm): 13 s wall. Cold AIR cache: llvm_ir 5.5 s, backend 6.1 s, link 0.8 s. Warm AIR cache: llvm_ir 1.8 s, backend 10.0 s, link 1.0 s. Same wall time either way.\n- Haxe build of the same app, no compile server: 6.4 s.\n- rayde.hl (5.6 MB hl, 49 MB wasm): 36 s wall with warm AIR cache; backend 25.2 s, llvm_ir 7.0 s, link 3.0 s.\n- Stage sum for PocketApp is ~19 s, short of the ~30 s seen. Not yet attributed: cold Haxe compile server in a fresh session, first-connection and staging costs.\n\nNot measured: the same run on the NUC, the cold-session vs warm-session split through scripts/warm-preview.mjs, and a true cold AIR run with --no-air-cache.\n\nUpstream (Ash, ash-7d has the stage logs): 8b12bc8 LLVM artifact reuse, 3b7fa54 shard parsing.\n\nNext if picked up: run warm-preview.mjs against a throwaway session (fresh workspace copy, no preview cache) for the cold-session, edit, and warm-cache times, and time the Haxe stage inside the session.","files":null}]}